" target=3D"_blank">https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec</a><br>
<br>
- Technical changes can be submitted as pull requests and are subject<br>
&nbsp; to the usual WG consensus process before being merged. No<br>
&nbsp; substantive technical discussion should occur in github. If you<br>
&nbsp; cannot submit a pull request, you can send text directly to the list=
<br>
